  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18602,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Wireframe a Web App Idea\r\n\r\n**Your Goal:** Create wireframes that clearly show:\r\n- how each page is organized\r\n- what content appears on each page\r\n- how a user would move between pages\r\n\r\n**Work with your partner to:**\r\n- Choose one website ideas from the list below.\r\n- **Each of you** create **2 different pages** (4 in total).\r\n- **Save** all wireframes **to your backpack.**\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n:::details [**Choose One Of These Website Ideas**]\r\n- Local food vendor website\r\n- School club website\r\n- Art gallery website\r\n- Fitness tracker app\r\n- Online bookstore\r\n- Pet adoption website\r\n- Travel guide for a city or country\r\n- Event planning or ticketing website\r\n- Gaming leaderboard or stats tracker\r\n- Recipe or cooking website\r\n- Language learning  app\r\n:::\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n:::details [**AI Chat Optional Support**] \r\nIf you get stuck, you can use the AI Chat Wireframe Partner back in Level 1b to brainstorm page ideas or get suggestions for what components to include on each page.\r\n:::",
